{
  "sequence_id": "seq_e8b4f75454f9491f",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "There's a devil out here?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Can't see one..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Guess it's hiding somewhere..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "MANGA STREAMLEN do not minor"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Denji boy... ya have our thanks."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Ah... yeah..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "obedient like a dog."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Happy to work for cheap treats like a dog too,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "thing is though, I hate the stench of fucking dogs."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "MANGA STREAMLOR DO Nogmirror"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "us Yakuza,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "We wanted to get stronger to make more money,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "So we made a contract with a devil like you did."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "What we wanted was a devil's power..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "And what I wanted was devil hunters'..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "MAN STRE: So not my"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Death!"
    }
  ],
